@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100
@accessToken = paste-a-Keycloak-access-token-here
@accountId = replace-with-account-id
@destinationAccountId = replace-with-another-account-id

### List recent transactions across the signed-in customer's accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filter by account, time range, and transaction label
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?accountId={{accountId}}&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00%2B04:00&to=2026-11-01T00:00:00%2B04:00&search=groceries&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid date range returns a validation problem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create demo e-commerce spending
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "EcommercePurchase",
  "amount": 24.95,
  "label": "Demo online shopping"
}

### Create a demo salary credit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "SalaryReceived",
  "amount": 2500.00
}

### Create a demo transfer between two owned accounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{destinationAccountId}}",
  "type": "MoneyTransfer",
  "amount": 125.00
}

### Demo debits with insufficient funds return 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "AtmWithdrawal",
  "amount": 1000000.00
}

### Get a transaction by ID (use the ID returned by a successful POST)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/replace-with-transaction-id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
